// endpoint_pass_cold_gate.proto — PassColdGate: a workspace's agent passes
// ANOTHER workspace's cold gate. AGENT API section.
//
// THE ONE WAY AN AGENT PASSES A COLD GATE IS A HAIKU COMPACTION OF ALL THE
// CONTEXT (owner ruling, 2026-11-18). The request names no choice, so paying
// the cold read and clearing the context are unrepresentable here: they stay
// the user's, answered on the gate card (AnswerColdGate). The daemon answers
// the standing gate exactly as the card's `compact` button would with the
// Haiku summarizer and the `all` scope, so the prompts held at the gate stay
// held for the user to send, and the re-open's progress and outcome are the
// footer's, as for any answered gate.

